2. DEVELOPER FEE (DISCLOSED)
   The Software mines for the developer's wallet 0.75% of its mining time, on
   the same pool you mine on, as described in the README and reported in the
   Software's own log. You agree not to disable, block, circumvent, redirect or
   alter the developer fee or the log messages that disclose it. This is the
   only fee; the Software mines for your wallet the remaining 99.25% of the time
   and sends nothing else anywhere.

